							"string" : "The specification uses {{gtMethod:GtPhlowExplicitView>>#declarativeStencil:}} so the local rendering also participates in the remote declarative pipeline. The boundary is important: computation blocks stay with the view/data source; specifications, view data, and declarative stencils must be serializable."
