							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The picture data consists of bytes plus picture metadata. The generic specification creates a {{gtClass:GtPhlowNamedStencil}} using the configured rendering-stencil name. This is useful when callers may choose the renderer. {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowPictureViewTestObject>>#gtViewPictureScaledWithExtentFor:}} selects a full-size local-only stencil through {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowPictureView>>#renderingStencilName:}}."
