							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "XvBZZtdyTG6zj8Uxv9LD+w=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The specification's {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserViewSpecification>>#viewFor:}} follows the shared rule: it creates an explicit view, sets `phlowViewSpecification: self`, and uses {{gtMethod:GtPhlowExplicitView>>#declarativeStencil:}}. {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserViewSpecification>>#createDeclarativeContentStencil}} resolves the needed values and answers either an error stencil or the dedicated browser stencil."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
