							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The browser stencil subclasses {{gtClass:GtPhlowStencil}}. Unlike the view, it receives values rather than blocks, and it can be used on its own in an explicit declarative view, as in {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserStencilTestObject>>#gtWebBrowserHeadersFor:}}."
