							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Choose the **browser-style custom pipeline** when data has separate retrieval paths, needs custom composition before rendering, has specialized caching or refreshing behavior, or otherwise cannot fit the generic data-source/specification contract."
